WEBVTT

00:00:07.403 --> 00:00:08.483
Mike?

00:00:08.523 --> 00:00:11.043
-It's not that I don't care.
-Mike, you don't understand.

00:00:11.123 --> 00:00:13.283
Yes, I do.
I was just mad, that's all.

00:00:13.363 --> 00:00:17.683
I needed some time to think, but
you shouldn't have left me out there.

00:00:18.283 --> 00:00:20.683
-I'm being attacked.
-I'm not attacking you.

00:00:20.763 --> 00:00:24.283
I'm trying to be honest. Hear me out.
You and I are a team.

00:00:24.363 --> 00:00:26.963
Nothing is more important
than our friendship.

00:00:27.043 --> 00:00:28.723
I know. He's too sensitive.

00:00:29.763 --> 00:00:31.483
(WHINING CRY)

00:00:31.523 --> 00:00:34.443
Come on, pal.
If you start crying, I'm gonna cry.

00:00:34.563 --> 00:00:35.923
And I'll never get through this.

00:00:36.763 --> 00:00:39.843
I'm sorry I wasn't there for you,
but I am now.

00:00:39.883 --> 00:00:44.043
Sulley, I am baring my soul here.
The least you can do is pay attention.

00:00:45.203 --> 00:00:46.723
(GROANS)

00:00:48.483 --> 00:00:50.563
Look at that. It's Randall.

00:00:52.163 --> 00:00:53.403
Come on.

00:00:53.963 --> 00:00:56.603
Get up. There can't be any witnesses.

00:00:56.723 --> 00:00:57.883
There won't be.

00:00:58.403 --> 00:01:00.083
I'm glad you came back, Mike.

00:01:00.123 --> 00:01:02.123
Somebody's gotta take care of you,
you big hairball.

00:01:02.203 --> 00:01:03.243
(CELIA SCREAMING)

00:01:06.723 --> 00:01:09.083
-Schmoopsie-pooh, I can't talk.
-Come on.

00:01:09.163 --> 00:01:13.683
Michael, if you don't tell me what's
going on right now, we are through!

00:01:14.163 --> 00:01:15.243
Here's the truth.

00:01:15.283 --> 00:01:19.603
The kid? Sulley let her in. We tried to
send her back, Waternoose had a plot,

00:01:19.643 --> 00:01:22.043
and now Randall's trying to kill us!

00:01:22.083 --> 00:01:25.363
You expect me to believe
that pack of lies, Mike Wazowski?

00:01:25.603 --> 00:01:26.683
Mike Wazowski.

00:01:27.923 --> 00:01:30.083
I love you, schmoopsie-pooh!

00:01:30.163 --> 00:01:33.283
-RANDALL: Hey!
-Idiots.

00:01:34.283 --> 00:01:35.923
Look out. Coming through.

00:01:36.003 --> 00:01:38.763
Make way. Move it.
Hurry up, hurry up.

00:01:40.363 --> 00:01:42.843
-There they are.
-CELIA ON PA: Attention, employees.

00:01:42.963 --> 00:01:46.803
Randall Boggs has just broken
the all-time scare record.

00:01:47.563 --> 00:01:50.043
No, I didn't.
Get out of my way.

00:01:50.643 --> 00:01:52.563
Go get 'em, googly bear.

00:01:53.883 --> 00:01:54.923
MIKE: There it is.

00:01:55.243 --> 00:01:57.643
Get off my tail. Let go.

00:02:01.763 --> 00:02:03.243
-What are you doing?
-Grab on, Mike.

00:02:03.283 --> 00:02:06.163
Are you out of your mind?

00:02:16.163 --> 00:02:19.243
-Sulley, what are we doing?
-Get Boo's door and find a station.

00:02:19.443 --> 00:02:21.923
MIKE: What a plan.
Simple, yet insane.

00:02:35.763 --> 00:02:36.963
-Whoa.
-Oh, boy.

00:02:37.803 --> 00:02:39.403
Hold on!

00:02:39.483 --> 00:02:40.963
(SCREAMING)

00:02:48.163 --> 00:02:49.763
Don't look down!

00:02:50.723 --> 00:02:51.963
(TEETH CHATTERING)

00:03:05.643 --> 00:03:07.043
I'm gonna be sick.

00:03:11.563 --> 00:03:12.883
MIKE: Oh, no.

00:03:16.883 --> 00:03:18.083
No!

00:03:19.443 --> 00:03:21.523
-Boo's door.
-There it is.

00:03:21.763 --> 00:03:24.363
How are we supposed to get to it now?

00:03:27.643 --> 00:03:29.243
It's a dead end, Sulley.

00:03:31.003 --> 00:03:32.523
-There he is.
-Make her laugh.

00:03:32.563 --> 00:03:33.883
-Sulley!
-Just do it!

00:03:35.843 --> 00:03:36.843
(LAUGHING)

00:03:43.883 --> 00:03:46.123
-Get it open.
-Here he comes.

00:03:46.203 --> 00:03:47.843
Give me that kid.

00:03:52.923 --> 00:03:56.563
-Why couldn't we get banished here?
-We gotta find another door.

00:04:02.203 --> 00:04:03.963
Look! Boo's door.

00:04:08.603 --> 00:04:11.443
-There he is. Hurry up!
-Give me your hand.

00:04:12.203 --> 00:04:13.603
(SCREAMING)

00:04:18.363 --> 00:04:20.963
-MIKE: Come on, it slides.
-Right. Right.

00:04:24.723 --> 00:04:26.243
Jump. I'm right behind you.

00:04:31.403 --> 00:04:32.803
Come on.

00:04:34.803 --> 00:04:36.283
Hurry up. Keep moving!

00:04:36.323 --> 00:04:37.483
Get inside.

00:04:38.963 --> 00:04:40.643
That was weird.

00:04:41.123 --> 00:04:42.363
Mike?

00:04:42.443 --> 00:04:44.683
-Sorry, buddy.
-OK.

00:04:52.523 --> 00:04:54.323
I hope that hurt, lizard boy.

00:04:59.483 --> 00:05:01.443
Great job, buddy. We lost him.

00:05:01.563 --> 00:05:02.803
Boo!

00:05:04.243 --> 00:05:05.483
No!

00:05:05.763 --> 00:05:07.483
(BOTH SCREAMING)

00:05:07.563 --> 00:05:09.323
Nice working with you.

00:05:09.723 --> 00:05:11.163
-Get it open!
-MIKE: I'm trying!

00:05:11.243 --> 00:05:13.483
-Open the door!
-Come on, get in here.

00:05:17.443 --> 00:05:18.483
(BOO CRYING)

00:05:23.523 --> 00:05:24.763
Boo!

00:05:28.163 --> 00:05:29.723
There they are!

00:05:33.523 --> 00:05:36.083
Sulley, what are you doing?
Sulley!

00:05:40.363 --> 00:05:43.243
-Looks like we caught the express.
-Do you see them?

00:05:43.323 --> 00:05:45.003
Straight ahead.

